  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">슬슬 중간고사 끝나고 수업에 할 실험들을 준비해야 해서</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">또 한 번 과학실에 갔습니다</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size14\">(통합과학 중화반응 역시나 실패... 김주형 선생님 조언대로 그냥 1M 염화나트륨 염산 다 사기로 ㅜㅜ 빨리 와~~)</span></p><div data-ke-type=\"emoticon\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-emoticon-type=\"friends1\" data-emoticon-name=\"001\" data-emoticon-isanimation=\"false\" data-emoticon-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/axz_keditor/emoticon/friends1/large/001.gif\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/axz_keditor/emoticon/friends1/large/001.gif\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">수행평가용 실험은 우선 미뤄두고</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">화학 반응의 세계가 당장 다음주 산화 환원 반응에 들어가서</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">교과서에 있는 실험 황산구리수용액+아연 넣기가 있어서 해보려고 합니다</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d6e59b195a895716101e997ddcea6b4b2f4b2960_re_1790831547630\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\" style=\"width:50.00%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d6e59b195a895716101e997ddcea6b4b2f4b2960_re_1790831547630\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/851cb94564096a09e02f3d13fde865c7cb6f483d_re_1790831547630\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\" style=\"width:50.00%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/851cb94564096a09e02f3d13fde865c7cb6f483d_re_1790831547630\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">사실... 할 수 있을 줄 몰랐는데</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">피펫 사면서 아연판을 사뒀더라구요</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">한 달 전의 나 최고!</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">하나는 사포질 X 하나는 사포질 해보았습니다</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rve07gwbmizbbj9belmon9dry?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"782\" data-video-height=\"782\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rve07gwbmizbbj9belmon9dry/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33347734031&amp;kamp_tidx=0&amp;signature=dkP3Wy%2FdkRhgOKfHrE9HsLrxK9k%3D&amp;ts=1790825231\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"782\" data-video-origin-height=\"782\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rve07gwbmizbbj9belmon9dry?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2ZTA3Z3dibWl6YmJqOWJlbG1vbjlkcnkiLCJ0aWQiOiIxY2MzMTNmZS04OGI4LTRjYTgtOTcyMi0yZmQwMWE3MjI2MDEiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTE3NjQ1MTJ9.6q1A_SrU5XPty4DFnncBgl8fkrNIcvXjTFDSoG2_GFe5qNZl2VooCRSBJSkd4PqLMGUILmaMCJYrjlJ5aNPbXg&amp;autoplay=0&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2ZTA3Z3dibWl6YmJqOWJlbG1vbjlkcnkiLCJ0aWQiOiIxY2MzMTNmZS04OGI4LTRjYTgtOTcyMi0yZmQwMWE3MjI2MDEiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTE3NjQ1MTJ9.6q1A_SrU5XPty4DFnncBgl8fkrNIcvXjTFDSoG2_GFe5qNZl2VooCRSBJSkd4PqLMGUILmaMCJYrjlJ5aNPbXg&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"782\" height=\"782\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/485ae32db42f88a2421d5b81648669ed211b234a_re_1790831547630\" data-origin-width=\"868\" data-origin-height=\"438\" style=\"width:72.54%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/485ae32db42f88a2421d5b81648669ed211b234a_re_1790831547630\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d44727c39d3ceca080dbf70ed635d4a5224e2fa6_re_1790831547631\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\" style=\"width:27.46%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d44727c39d3ceca080dbf70ed635d4a5224e2fa6_re_1790831547631\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">사실... 솔직히 말하자면</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">이 실험은 영상으로도 안보고 항상 이미지로만 봤어서</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">제가 <b>상상한</b> 황산구리 수용액+아연 실험은</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">아연이 천천히 산화가 일어나는 거였는데&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">순식간에 넣자마자 새까매져서 당황했습니다...</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">(이론적으로만 알고 실제로 본 적은 처음이라)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">그리고 황산구리 수용액이 농도가 안적혀있어서 별로 안진하</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">겠지 했는데</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">되게~~ 진한 거더라구요 ㅎㅎ</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b75d32ad7d17e9f196546df3874abfa9d2af234e_re_1790831547631\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\" style=\"width:50.00%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b75d32ad7d17e9f196546df3874abfa9d2af234e_re_1790831547631\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/498c60dee64133929c3f7046d413104e668e51c8_re_1790831547631\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\" style=\"width:50.00%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/498c60dee64133929c3f7046d413104e668e51c8_re_1790831547631\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">더 묽혀도 쉽게 잘돼서 당황...</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">아무튼 진한 용액 꺼낸 거 너무 아까워서 따로 포장(?) 해서 다시 시약장으로...</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">너는 다음주 실험에 쓰일 것이다.</p><div data-ke-type=\"emoticon\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-emoticon-type=\"friends1\" data-emoticon-name=\"016\" data-emoticon-isanimation=\"false\" data-emoticon-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/axz_keditor/emoticon/friends1/large/016.gif\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/axz_keditor/emoticon/friends1/large/016.gif\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">그런데 ... 이렇게 반응이 빨리 일어나버리면...</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">일부러 과학실까지 부른 보람이 없는데...</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">(공사중이라 2학년-과학실이 멀어서 쩝)</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4ba4af19d8bb384ea4360cbee50d41694e902eca_re_1790831547631\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4ba4af19d8bb384ea4360cbee50d41694e902eca_re_1790831547631\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"768\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">교과서를 보니 마그네슘의 연소가 있고</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">마침 통합과학 실험 때문에 사둔 마그네슘 리본 ㅎㅎ</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">(사고 칠 준비 완)</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/137c37c2f1c2c2ce27372397b3b9d440ff93554b_re_1790831547632\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/137c37c2f1c2c2ce27372397b3b9d440ff93554b_re_1790831547632\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">...</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">내가 학생이 아니라 교사라 정말 다행이다...</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">별로 안 위험할 줄 알고 교과서 그림만큼 길게 했다가 불꽃쇼를 관람했습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/360653e91590795ea6608c9bb68cb6b3df91bb66_re_1790831547632\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/360653e91590795ea6608c9bb68cb6b3df91bb66_re_1790831547632\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">이 난리를 치고도 ㅎㅎ 흰색이다!! 하고 좋아했습니다</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv72tvvf9okguwub6t71pfncf?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"1080\" data-video-height=\"1080\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rv72tvvf9okguwub6t71pfncf/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33347734050&amp;kamp_tidx=0&amp;signature=1GVAYP6YyP2qGDZvKmn04yKr8k4%3D&amp;ts=1790825250\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"1080\" data-video-origin-height=\"1080\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv72tvvf9okguwub6t71pfncf?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2NzJ0dnZmOW9rZ3V3dWI2dDcxcGZuY2YiLCJ0aWQiOiJlNTY1Y2Q4OC00MWI2LTRjZjgtYTVmMS04N2VjZjc3YjFjMzAiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTE3NjQ1MTJ9.rJwxbB9RYjooStU6rj0oYUVlDF8tpCvX_CXBzDBFSP60gy_Yk7yokctZRIt10qqeX5o8bhNrdyVqiTYVJzfOUg&amp;autoplay=0&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2NzJ0dnZmOW9rZ3V3dWI2dDcxcGZuY2YiLCJ0aWQiOiJlNTY1Y2Q4OC00MWI2LTRjZjgtYTVmMS04N2VjZjc3YjFjMzAiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTE3NjQ1MTJ9.rJwxbB9RYjooStU6rj0oYUVlDF8tpCvX_CXBzDBFSP60gy_Yk7yokctZRIt10qqeX5o8bhNrdyVqiTYVJzfOUg&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">다시 한 번 제대로 시도</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">딱 이 정도 길이가 애들 관심 끌기도 좋고 결과도 잘 나오는 거 같네요</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><s>내년엔 통합과학에서도 어그로 끌고 시작해야지</s></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">오늘 실험을 계기로</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">예비실험의 중요성을 깨달았습니다...</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">실제로 해보지 않으면 모르는 것들이 많네요...</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">제가 이미 사고쳤으니 선생님들은 안전한 실험 하세요!! ^^7</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}